<div class="col-span-full lg:col-start-4 [&+&]:mt-15 rich-text-block
  lg:col-span-6
  ">

          
        
        <div class="wysiwyg rich-text-content col-span-full ">
      <p>Each idea below is a high-priority initiative to reduce the <a href="https://coefficientgiving.org/funds/navigating-transformative-ai/">potentially catastrophic risks from AI</a>, endorsed by a grantmaker who has thought about the problem and wants to fund a solution.</p>
<p>This page isn’t close to comprehensive. We’d be excited to fund many initiatives that aren’t listed, and an initiative&#8217;s inclusion doesn&#8217;t mean <em>no one</em> is working on that problem — only that we want to fund more work on it, including from existing teams. If you&#8217;re already working on a relevant project, or if you have an idea that could do more to reduce catastrophic risks from AI than what you’re reading here, <a href="/tailwind/get-involved/">we want to hear from you</a>.</p>

    </div>
    
        
